This file marks a FocusBar that came from the portable zip.

When you run FocusBar.exe from this folder, it offers to install or update your FocusBar in
%LocalAppData%\Programs\FocusBar (closing the running FocusBar first), so every new zip updates the
same copy instead of making another one. Your deadlines, settings, and pictures (in %AppData%\FocusBar)
aren't touched. Choose "No" to just run FocusBar from this folder.
